      ],
      "source": "https://www.trawellino.com/destinations/united-states/north-carolina_la-grange",
      "category": "etymology",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "The Norfolk and Southern Railroad, built through Moseley Hall between 1855 and 1858, sparked commerce and accelerated La Grange’s growth.",
